{
 "title": "Course timetable for one week",
 "proves": [
  "an enrolment is admitted only when the student completed the prerequisite course (T1), checked again from the data",
  "every session sits in a room that holds all admitted students (T2)",
  "a teacher teaches one session in a slot and never in an unavailable slot (T3)",
  "a room hosts one session in a slot (T4)",
  "no student has two sessions in one slot (T5)",
  "each course gets all its sessions, one on each day at most (T6)",
  "the search needs backtracks: the greedy first choices leave a later course without a place",
  "a demand that no timetable can meet is reported as infeasible, and an exhausted budget is reported as not proven",
  "the decision evidence names the rule and the reason for each place that a session did not get, or undone when the search tried the place and undid it",
  "the same model, data and seed give the same timetable on every run"
 ],
